Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.69,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in what I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.19,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want,\Ntogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.94,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,0)\blur0.4\c&H141414&\3c&H141414&\1a&HFF&\t(689,734,\1a&H00&)}Tin Plate Wapol
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.98,0:01:54.94,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,0)\blur0.4\bord0\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Tin Plate Wapol
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.57,0:01:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will go to Elbaf someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.53,0:02:00.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the village of warriors!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.55,0:02:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.95,0:02:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaggy giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.93,0:02:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaggy giants! Elbaf! Elbaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.19,0:02:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone is huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.65,0:02:11.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're so huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.99,0:02:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because they're giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.75,0:02:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gi-gi-giants!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do they get so much\Nenergy? Everybody's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, after everything that's\Nhappened here, I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Vivi, could you\Nwatch this for me? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.91,0:02:41.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.31,0:02:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon you'll return to Alabasta. Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.83,0:02:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my rosy outlook is assuming we can make it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.93,0:02:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there safely and without\Nany more surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:50.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I must return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my obligation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the person everyone in\Nthe kingdom is counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.23,0:02:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe me when I say it is the\Nonly way to save the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is true that your father no\Nlonger has sway with the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.17,0:03:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our only hope of stopping this uprising\Nis for you to tell them the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.89,0:03:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only action that can save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to understand that\Nyour survival is paramount.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.19,0:03:17.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must live, even if it\Nmeans sacrificing others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.35,0:03:20.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether by grace or betrayal,\Nlive on, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.37,0:03:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes, it's harder\Nto live than to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.33,0:03:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will return home, alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll get home but\Nthere's no need to push
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.41,0:03:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yourself so hard you've\Ngot me here you go try.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.25,0:03:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These sweets will help\Nyou relax. I've made
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.65,0:03:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some delicious tarts and\Nyour choice of coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or tea? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.93,0:03:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you yours
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.97,0:04:00.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are in the kitchen now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.03,0:04:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,six oh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.97,0:04:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,three six oh
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.11,0:04:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,four six oh five six six?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.27,0:04:25.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I only got to cut that wax, I\Nwouldn't have left anyone hanging there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.13,0:04:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.21,0:04:32.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to get stronger,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to be able to slice through\Nstuff like that from any stance.
