Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.11,0:04:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:51.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,2, Kureha, the Swanda\Nis ready to set sail.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I heard you. Chouchou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.75,0:04:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have to scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.61,0:05:00.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, somebody give me one good\Nreason why I should be the one to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.18,0:05:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3 is a piece of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go toss him out yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.89,0:05:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.09,0:05:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't even stand\Na chance against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you have to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.75,0:05:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those were the boss's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.79,0:05:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.57,0:05:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's four again? Anybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.69,0:05:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.57,0:05:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.93,0:05:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi. I'm sorry, but I...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:41.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.99,0:05:43.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.17,0:05:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.35,0:05:45.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.61,0:05:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Course,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.52,0:05:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.53,0:05:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.44,0:05:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, everyone, come quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.19,0:05:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.27,0:06:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami has an awful
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.01,0:06:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.37,0:06:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.69,0:06:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's most likely the climate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.95,0:06:36.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quite normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.44,0:06:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sailors in the Grand Line are used to the\Nstrange weather and can become quite ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:45.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are countless stories of tough,\Nnotorious pirates who suddenly died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.67,0:06:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their immune systems were attacked\Nand ravaged by colds and fevers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.37,0:06:54.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ignoring the symptoms can make\Neven the slightest cold deadly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.89,0:06:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.53,0:06:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone aboard this ship with even
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.49,0:07:02.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the slightest amount\Nof medical experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, when you're sick, eating\Nlots of meat always helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.31,0:07:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.69,0:07:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat is protein, and that does give\Nthe body energy to operate properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.97,0:07:19.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can cook some foods that'll boost\Nyour energy, but there's no guarantees.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.09,0:07:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, if my cooking made that big\Na difference, she'd never get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.61,0:07:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I put a hundred times more care into\Npreparing her meals than I do for you losers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.93,0:07:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I serve Nami fresh meats and\Nvegetables to ensure a balanced diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.07,0:07:36.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything that's rotten or\Nmoldy goes to you. Jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.15,0:07:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh well, still tastes good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.77,0:07:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My point is that as long\Nas I'm this ship's cook,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nobody's going to feed Nami\Nbetter in terms of nutrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do anything in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.91,0:07:53.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I do know that there are specific\Nfoods for different kinds of illnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can't make that call.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:58.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She needs to be diagnosed by a doctor\Nwho'll tell us how to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.69,0:08:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just feed her everything that we've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.31,0:08:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.49,0:08:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She doesn't have the energy to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.51,0:08:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One hundred more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.91,0:08:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, this isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's bound to be doctors and nurses\Nin Alabasta that can help, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.79,0:08:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much longer till we get there, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.25,0:08:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least a week, and that's too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:21.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, so she's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we're overreacting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.09,0:08:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.15,0:08:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been this sick. Morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.61,0:08:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you all lost your minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.19,0:08:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She shouldn't have such a high fever\Nunless her body's fighting an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.67,0:08:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.95,0:08:37.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever's wrong, it's\Npossibly life-threatening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.65,0:08:40.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean Nabi's gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.99,0:08:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your screams aren't helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to find a doctor to\Nhelp Nami before she dies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.27,0:08:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, everyone just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.03,0:08:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're only going to make her feel worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.07,0:08:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.01,0:09:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.69,0:09:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.60,0:09:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's cute! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.11,0:09:06.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to my desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Open the second drawer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.87,0:09:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a newspaper in the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No change in our course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.01,0:09:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.17,0:09:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.07,0:09:24.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What's up? Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.19,0:09:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it about Alabasta? Tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.73,0:09:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,According to this article, 300,000 royal\Nsoldiers have defected to the resistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:35.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've been embroiled\Nin a cold war with 600
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:40.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,,000 royal soldiers\Nagainst 400,000 rebels.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.17,0:09:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With this, the balance has shifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.73,0:09:47.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The uprising in Alabasta\Nwill seriously escalate now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.15,0:09:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things will get ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.27,0:09:51.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That paper you're looking\Nat is three days old
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.51,0:09:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.42,0:09:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say something earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't change our speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:57.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I didn't want to\Nworry you There's nothing
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.87,0:10:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,anyone can do right now\NYou understand Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are bad and\Nthey're beyond our control
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it sunk in better than I'd hope Nami Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.77,0:10:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need to see a doctor right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:10.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.87,0:10:15.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The thermometer is broken I mean come\Non nobody gets a temperature of 104.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.55,0:10:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably just a mild\Ncase of sunstroke. There's
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.79,0:10:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nothing a doctor can do\Nfor me that time won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.53,0:10:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't have\Ntime to hunt for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.69,0:10:26.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to head straight\Nfor Alabasta, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate the concern. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.43,0:10:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She sure recovered fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.11,0:10:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she's faking.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.57,0:10:52.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that this conflict has escalated,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,more blood will be shed\Nthroughout the kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.77,0:10:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't put a stop to this insanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:01.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the entire kingdom of\NAlabasta will be doomed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile will move in and seize control.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:07.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're trying to get me home\Nsafely, but there's no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.55,0:11:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get home as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.91,0:11:11.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't make it back in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.63,0:11:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a million innocent citizens will\Ngive their lives needlessly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.01,0:11:17.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a million people there? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.35,0:11:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a horrible burden you\Nhave to carry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.45,0:11:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saru, what the hell have you\Nbeen watching all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.99,0:11:38.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.07,0:11:41.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been going straight\Nahead as you ordered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.13,0:11:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, straight at a right angle.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.97,0:11:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the eternal pose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.29,0:11:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.65,0:11:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been using that big\Ncloud over there as my guide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.07,0:11:49.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clouds move and change shape constantly!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.95,0:11:52.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.01,0:11:54.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, my head's killing me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.63,0:11:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So leave them navigating\Nto me and go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.99,0:12:01.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish that I could, but I'm here\Nbecause I can't trust you with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.01,0:12:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The air has changed. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weather's been nice like this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.51,0:12:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:11.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your butts out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.43,0:12:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.73,0:12:14.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.17,0:12:19.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I find it hard to get\Nmotivated when you're giving the orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.55,0:12:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.35,0:12:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the seat and catch\Nthe port side wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.07,0:12:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.21,0:12:26.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.45,0:12:28.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The waves are quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.31,0:12:30.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.69,0:12:32.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a powerful wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.43,0:12:37.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's heading right this way. I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.29,0:12:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your head's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.19,0:12:43.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta stay in bed and\Nwe need to get you a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.71,0:12:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.57,0:12:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my normal temperature.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.09,0:12:49.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now quit being so stupid\Nand pull the damn ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.59,0:12:50.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.50,0:12:53.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're acting brave for\NVivi, but if you keep pushing,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.35,0:12:54.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your body won't have a chance to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.91,0:12:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.82,0:12:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you guys I'm fine. Let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.91,0:13:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hey, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.57,0:13:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not another word, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and move the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:09.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.37,0:13:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chouchou, something I don't know, but\Nsomething's headed this way and soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to get home before time runs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to ask you all a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.45,0:14:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a passenger on your ship, it's not my\Nplace to ask this, but I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.75,0:14:05.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My homeland is in jeopardy\Nof being destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I would really appreciate it\Nif we could move even faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.49,0:14:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every minute I'm out here puts more of my\Npeople in danger of losing their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.71,0:14:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to head for\NAlabasta at full speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.05,0:14:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, we will just like we promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then it's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find an island with\Na doctor on it right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.67,0:14:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first, we need to\Nhurry and get Nami healthy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.01,0:14:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we head for Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, we need her at the\Nhelm to move at top speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.43,0:14:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.34,0:14:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one makes this ship move like Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.45,0:14:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.81,0:14:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Won't finding a doctor for Nami take time\Nthe citizens of Alabasta just don't have?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.99,0:14:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.90,0:14:49.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the sooner we get Nami a doctor,\Nthe sooner we can get to Alabasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.37,0:14:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are wise words, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.37,0:14:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're beautiful and brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The girl's got guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.21,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't overexert yourself, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.64,0:15:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.67,0:15:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I may need to, like... Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.49,0:15:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.09,0:15:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a cyclone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.37,0:15:16.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the same path we were headed on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.63,0:15:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.59,0:15:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the exact same direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would've been a direct hit\Nif we kept going straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be dead right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.65,0:15:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.77,0:15:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.05,0:15:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We barely missed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.57,0:15:39.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.48,0:15:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cyclones in the Grand Line are\Nsaid to be impossible to predict.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.33,0:15:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow Nami did.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.45,0:15:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However she does it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.57,0:15:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's obvious her technique isn't\Nbased on any conventional method.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:51.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if she's detecting\Nthe weather with her body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beyond reason. A miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.01,0:15:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.99,0:15:57.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find Nami a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.53,0:16:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.89,0:16:16.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\blur0.4\bord4.4\fscx92\fscy92\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp3\b0\pos(725,730)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(435,480,\1a&H00&)}The Next Day
Dialogue: 2,0:16:12.89,0:16:16.18,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx92\fscy92\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp3\c&HE6E6E6&\b0\pos(725,730)\4a&HFF&}The Next Day
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.81,0:16:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what are we going to do, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.97,0:16:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's fever won't go down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:27.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That behavior isn't helping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.53,0:16:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See any doctors yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lupi, you can't be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.51,0:16:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh hey guys what do you think about people
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.13,0:16:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,standing on water what\Ndo i think it's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.11,0:16:49.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of question\Nis that it's impossible
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.79,0:16:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of course yeah well then\Nwhat's that what's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.71,0:16:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, sure it's chilly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.01,0:17:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is chilly today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.43,0:17:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Definitely, it's very chilling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.95,0:17:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I would even say it's freezing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.19,0:17:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Increase buoyancy! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that thing? A watermelon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.99,0:17:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are we shaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.53,0:17:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold the rudder steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.91,0:17:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If anything happens to Nami, I'll\Nhold every one of you responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.95,0:17:55.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.01,0:18:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pirate ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.09,0:18:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.05,0:18:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.96,0:18:27.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when we needed to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.95,0:18:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:35.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me our underwater raid\Nship, the Tin Tyrant, surprised you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.83,0:18:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe, you're in charge. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.73,0:19:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:05.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we're under attack\Nand it's still snowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.67,0:19:13.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, the guns pointing\Nat my face kind of gave
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that one away what next you\Nall consider Yourself a band
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.15,0:19:20.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of pirates that's amusing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i only count for you sort
Dialogue: 1,0:19:25.41,0:19:31.34,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(725,652)\fad(483,0)\blur0.4\bord4.4\fscx92\fscy92\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp3\c&HE6E6E6&\b0}"Tin Plate" Wapol\NBliking Pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of strange that your group\Nwould have so few members.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.51,0:19:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kid, it's just weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of guy likes to eat knives? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:42.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My gums are bleeding just watching!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll keep this simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.41,0:19:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, my men here and I wish\Nto travel to Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't happen to have an\Neternal pose or a Log Pose, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.61,0:19:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, can't help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.97,0:19:59.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I've never even\Nheard of this Drum Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.23,0:20:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now that we have that all settled,\Nwould you guys just leave already?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry, and we don't\Nhave time to deal with all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.25,0:20:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never enjoy life if\Nyou're always in a rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you have neither\Npose, what can be done?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.93,0:20:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suppose I'll have to settle\Nfor your treasure on this ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:16.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.59,0:20:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a bit hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.77,0:20:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a shippity monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.37,0:20:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, our ship isn't your lunch! Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.29,0:20:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wapol doesn't like to be\Ndisturbed while he's eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:34.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn pirate, we're under attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.29,0:20:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now things are finally\Nstarting to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.87,0:20:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is more like it. Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.73,0:20:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't we discuss this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.67,0:20:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They took it upon themselves\Nto start this. What fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.33,0:20:54.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got a death wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.41,0:20:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gunfire!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.37,0:20:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo, stay here and watch Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:20:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.25,0:21:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't take on\Nanything you can't handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.49,0:21:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reception!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.93,0:21:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Baratie, no bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.45,0:21:33.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, um, Wapol, we need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:36.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ship doesn't taste\Nhalf bad. Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.55,0:21:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're no master Wapol.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:45.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you'll be eaten by the\Npower of the Munch Munch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.49,0:21:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me know!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.65,0:21:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.97,0:21:51.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey there, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.63,0:21:53.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything okay with Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.41,0:21:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer someone less chewy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.39,0:22:02.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.61,0:22:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waffle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.79,0:22:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.11,0:22:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sent Waffle flying out into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.41,0:22:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad? It's worse. It's a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.85,0:22:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waffle's gonna drown.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.89,0:22:21.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.83,0:22:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Recall the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.19,0:22:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.55,0:22:27.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to rescue him before\Nhe sinks to the bottom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.53,0:22:28.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.89,0:22:31.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is far from over! You'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.31,0:22:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you'll pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.71,0:22:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're dead, you brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.77,0:22:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better hope Waffle doesn't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.29,0:22:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or it's your blood we'll spill!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.37,0:22:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll get you for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.65,0:22:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.99,0:22:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are really upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.97,0:22:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were they calling that\Nold garbage can, Waffle?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about what his name was?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.55,0:22:54.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.89,0:22:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guy's obviously a moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.87,0:22:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Best to just forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.47,0:23:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.71,0:23:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But from where?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.27,0:23:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.71,0:23:20.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dows her in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.93,0:23:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That'll fix her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.07,0:23:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.05,0:23:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.33,0:23:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sun's about to set\Nand she's still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.15,0:23:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.06,0:23:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it would be best if\Nwe drop anchor somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't navigate at night anyway\Nwithout Nami's instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.13,0:23:35.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.59,0:24:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure is a cold one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.15,0:24:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Almost a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap, I fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.31,0:24:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:34.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't just sit around doing nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.05,0:24:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to find a way out of\Nthis jam as quick as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.83,0:24:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.91,0:24:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.09,0:24:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Usa, does this area\Nseem unusually calm and cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.01,0:24:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, now that you\Nmention it, it sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.75,0:24:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And to be honest, it's freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.67,0:25:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line just\Nkeeps getting stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:02.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not necessarily true.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.15,0:25:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.06,0:25:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe there's an island nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.07,0:25:09.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sanji, will you check the\Nhorizon for any sign of land?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.35,0:25:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.15,0:25:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a Winter Island\Nsomewhere nearby, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.23,0:25:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Winter Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.89,0:25:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scattered within the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.59,0:25:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are four basic types of islands\Nmade distinct by their varying climates.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.77,0:25:24.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got Summer Islands, Spring Islands,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.73,0:25:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Autumn Islands, and of\Ncourse Winter Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.73,0:25:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Each one has its own\Nfour independent seasons.
Dialogue: 2,0:25:28.78,0:25:40.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2\pos(720,83.25)\fad(1477,0)\blur0.8\bord2.5\fnAnimated\fs75\fsp1\c&H1D1C21&\3c&H1D1C21&\1a&HFF&\b0\t(300,1477,\1a&H00&)}Summery Summer            Wintery Winter
