Dialogue: 3,0:25:28.78,0:25:40.71,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an8\q2\pos(733.5,704.25)\fad(1300,0)\blur0.9\bord0\fscx78\fscy78\fnAnimated\fs75\fsp1\c&H3A79E4&\4a&HFF&\b0}Summer Island {\c&H8F63E5&}Spring Island {\c&H496A9C&}Autumn Island {\c&HEEE2D5&}Winter Island
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.63,0:25:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When traveling on the Grand Line,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.27,0:25:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there are at least 16 different types of
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.97,0:25:36.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,weather patterns you must\Nbe prepared to endure,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.61,0:25:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ranging from Summer Island, Summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.39,0:25:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all the way to Winter Island,\NWinter, and everything in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.55,0:25:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There can always be exceptions to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.67,0:25:46.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and you could even encounter unknown\Nclimates at any given moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.67,0:25:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.47,0:25:52.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Grand Line has all these different\Nislands, one after the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's the reason why the seas between
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.21,0:25:57.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,them have such crazy unstable\Nweather patterns. Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.87,0:26:01.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the closer you get to an island,\Nthe calmer the sea is around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.45,0:26:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why I asked Sanji\Nto start looking for land.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.07,0:26:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.98,0:26:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.27,0:26:08.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.09,0:26:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Island dead ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.03,0:26:15.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.69,0:26:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.85,0:26:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We found an island!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.89,0:26:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This means we can get\Nyou to a real doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.45,0:26:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll fix you up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.33,0:26:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.81,0:26:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.09,0:26:31.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.00,0:26:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go, Luke.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.92,0:26:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got her covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.53,0:26:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.07,0:26:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami's saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.99,0:26:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, it's snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.97,0:26:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A snow island. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.57,0:26:46.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.69,0:26:49.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just so there's no\Nmisunderstanding between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.31,0:26:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stopping to find Nami a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.61,0:26:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not here to have an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.71,0:26:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.67,0:26:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.19,0:27:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so white. It's no use. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.39,0:27:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.49,0:27:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure this is a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.97,0:27:06.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There could be snow monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.47,0:27:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, we don't even know if\Nthere's people there or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.29,0:27:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.20,0:27:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm having a relapse if I\Ndon't go to the island disease.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.21,0:27:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:15.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so white and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.25,0:27:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll get ready for the inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.57,0:27:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.35,0:27:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the snow!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.29,0:27:51.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.65,0:27:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're unlike anything I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.45,0:27:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Luffy, aren't you\Ncold dressed like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.61,0:28:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ten degrees below freezing out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.13,0:28:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's when bears get ready to hibernate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.53,0:28:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.44,0:28:06.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy. Cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.69,0:28:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just figured that out!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.19,0:28:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a stream of melted snow.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.39,0:28:17.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This may provide a good spot to disembark.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.37,0:28:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, guys, Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.13,0:28:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Search, who wants in?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.51,0:28:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess we gotta find people here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.53,0:28:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.35,0:28:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, go have fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.91,0:28:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's far enough, pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.05,0:28:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.96,0:28:46.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.65,0:28:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.56,0:28:49.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But they don't seem too friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.63,0:28:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll only say this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.79,0:28:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your kind is not welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.33,0:28:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.73,0:28:58.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only came here to find a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.01,0:29:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have someone who's sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.63,0:29:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.17,0:29:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't fight for that old trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.95,0:29:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our island.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.49,0:29:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't let any filthy pirates land here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.19,0:29:12.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise anchor and leave now or we'll\Nblow you and your ship out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.15,0:29:17.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great. We barely said\Nhello, and they already hate us?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.69,0:29:21.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big mistake!

